WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.938 --> 00:00:21.351
Jemima sat on her nest.

2
00:00:21.352 --> 00:00:28.421
She was going to have more ducklings.

3
00:00:28.422 --> 00:00:32.183
Peck! Peck!

4
00:00:32.184 --> 00:00:40.434
"My eggs are hatching!" Jemima cried.

5
00:00:40.435 --> 00:00:44.303
Finally a beak pecked through one egg.

6
00:00:44.304 --> 00:00:48.825
Then a tiny, wet duckling appeared.

7
00:00:48.826 --> 00:00:55.333
"My baby!" Jemima said happily.

8
00:00:55.334 --> 00:01:05.734
"You are so beautiful!"

9
00:01:05.735 --> 00:01:10.092
Jemima waited.

10
00:01:10.093 --> 00:01:16.732
But no more eggs hatched.

11
00:01:16.733 --> 00:01:25.774
So Jemima led her duckling outside.

12
00:01:25.775 --> 00:01:36.809
"Look at my new duckling!" she said proudly.

13
00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:44.756
Kep barked. "What a fine duckling," he said.

14
00:01:44.757 --> 00:01:50.156
But a duck named Dora laughed.

15
00:01:50.157 --> 00:01:55.046
"You only have one duckling, Jemima!" Dora said.

16
00:01:55.047 --> 00:02:06.135
"I have five ducklings."

17
00:02:06.136 --> 00:02:08.663
Jemima frowned.

18
00:02:08.664 --> 00:02:14.279
"I only have one baby this time," she said.

19
00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:17.421
"But he is perfect."

20
00:02:17.422 --> 00:02:20.342
"Ha-ha!" Dora said.

21
00:02:20.343 --> 00:02:24.989
"He's not as perfect as five ducklings!"

22
00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:27.538
She waddled away.

23
00:02:27.539 --> 00:02:35.533
And her five ducklings followed.
